    - target: {fileID: 8155196563527889371, guid: 13b57a95d84d92a46b84eb46ba8f0c56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'To start with something simple.

        To the right of the hotel
        you will find a guarded passage, behind which is a small square, with an
        alley on the opposite side. There you will find a package with parts that
        will enable you to assemble something.... Useful. Go get them, when you claim
        them you will find out what to do next.

        Don''t waste your time on
        foolishness.

        Agamemnon'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
